{
  "note": "Mihara: Bonding Chain \u2014 MG/Fire. Board now 1.020 OK on 2 graded comps after restraint-pacing fix (2026-08-21). Ensnaring Chains is modeled as a LIVE stack pool.\nRESTRAINT CHAINS: a live resource `restraint` [0..10], initial 10, recharged to 10 at every fullBurstEnd, and consumed at 0.4s per stack over 4s. Each consumption deals 50.06% damage and adds +1 Ensnaring stack.\nS2 STACK GENERATION: the 40-normals-in-Full-Burst trigger is the same event as consuming one Restraint Chain: it deals 50.06%, consumes 1 restraint, and adds +1 Ensnaring.\nBURST: Dragging Chain mirrors 20 Ensnaring stacks (1001%/s) for 10s and cancels Ensnaring.",
