  "caveats": [
    "skill1: Restraint Chains are a live resource (restraint [0..10]). They recharge to 10 at every fullBurstEnd and are consumed over 4s (0.4s per stack), each consumption dealing 50.06% damage and adding +1 Ensnaring.",
    "skill2: the 40-normals-in-Full-Burst trigger ALSO consumes 1 Restraint Chain and deals 50.06% damage per proc (the stack-gain and Restraint-consumption are the same event).",
    "skill1: the permanent Ensnaring DoT is LIVE \u2014 perResource {ensnaring, 25.08} recomputes each tick from the current stack count.",
    "skill2: the 40-normals-in-Full-Burst Ensnaring generation carries fbGate:\"inFb\" AND countScope:\"gated\".",
    "skill1: the fullBurstEnd recharge/consumption fires on every Full Burst end. The kit text says 'if this unit has just used her Burst Skill', but measured stack behavior (reaches 20 before burst) and board ratio (1.020) both require it every FB end in multi-B3 comps.",
    "skill2: incapacitated +20 and enemy-neutralized +1 lines are inert at scope lock."
  ],
